        "headline": "Winter Weather Advisory issued July 1 at 11:00AM AKDT until July 2 at 7:00AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Mixed precipitation. Additional snow accumulations up to\none inch and ice accumulations around a light glaze.\n\n* WHERE...Northwest Arctic Coast from Point Lay to Utqiagvik.\n\n* WHEN...Until 7 AM AKDT Thursday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel may be impacted.",
