        "event": "Special Weather Statement",
        "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued July 1 at 3:04AM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK",
        "description": "River gauge observations as of early Wednesday morning indicate a\nrelease from Lake No Lake is ongoing. Based upon basin estimates and\ncurrent river levels, flooding is not expected with the river\nforecast to reach bankfull conditions by late Wednesday morning. As\na result of the release, debris in the water is possible on the Taku\nRiver, extending down Taku Inlet, & into Stephens Passage,\nparticularly for Wednesday. Furthermore, the water temperature near\nthe Taku River may be much colder than ",
